  "notes": [
    "Game axes: X = Blender +X, Y = Blender +Z, Z = Blender -Y; pose bones use YZX Euler = three.js XYZ.",
    "Head pivot at the skull base (back of the neck, chin height), not the head centre; neck at the collar.",
    "Lids are rigid shells about their bone world X axis (a radius per vertex): blink +1.22 closes, +0.488 is the happy squint, lidD -0.1 neutral, -0.24 happy. Their pivots sit behind the eyes (a 13 cm opening needs an 11+ cm hinge for 1.22 rad), not at the eyeball centres.",
    "The mouth parting was cut in the model (round 2); the lower copies are jaw-side, the corners shared (sealed). A closed cavity pocket on the parting, a tongue on its floor (jaw).",
    "Weights quantized to an exact 255 sum; <= 4 influences. Ears: head (root) -> ear -> earTip (the hanging lobe below the fold).",
    "The shirt follows hips / spine / chest, its shoulders 32% on the upper arms, its neckline 30% neck; the shorts: the seat on the hips, each leg its own thigh, the cuff up to 40% shin.",
    "The sleeves follow the upper arms (the root on the chest, the cuffed opening 40% forearm).",
    "The sailor collar follows the chest (neckline 30% neck, its shoulder parts lifting with the arms as the shirt does); the scarf knot 80/20 chest / neck, its ends on the chest; the ears: head (the root rings in the skull) -> ear_ -> earTip_ over the top half.",
    "The lash rolls (Kaito_lash_L/R) are 100% lidU_*; the lids are painted per side from the skin under them.",
    "The tail: tail1 at its root inside the shorts (the root rings share the hips), tail2-4 along the centreline, tail4 in the cream top."
  ]
}